674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L5pGSfGHWIsQ7kNvwE1h1Na&_nc_oc=AdqSRBALQr5HtNzf2L7BGiZTT4Pz1J9E9uy64xG4za8XohS5g1E1z6NnsGMYxaJBPBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8yBBgqkwdg1Eyu_O78Dkerj6YL8dIWW7-zqSfVQO_LpA&oe=6A3D3BD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCo3uwNJuoMQ7kNvwGrmI-q&_nc_oc=AdpgJrbKpruxVk6L-aGRmwI0qcEQ6DT6wnoUTArtt0Eo6p3B-vaMWipdTHSET3X8xOg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rMHxbLtO4siptL93f62PVbDg-7Y-HCXQW-opjgArcsA&oe=6A3D4496"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WWbtauqC7KUQ7kNvwEQSy8Q&_nc_oc=Adr2pUACsCHVV_ADFPj5yRZxhpElzSi76iGNYpiRDJK1Y-h5VbIdfnV7wDg1Du5Q-Ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ZZ4WHD10p2d1o2MPiCtpbLz_edGa_L1vsfJvdn5WQyA&oe=6A3D40B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip